  "description": "In the rotten neighborhood of Changseong, a girl named Hui-Eon lived crushed under debt. When she was on the verge of being dragged into the red-light district, it was the gangster Mugeul, appearing like the wind, who saved her.\n\n *“I'm good at studying. I can pay off the debt without having to work down there.” \n\n“This little thing's surprisingly impressive. Start working here tomorrow.”*\n\nSpending time by Mugil's side, Hui-Eon gradually succumbs to his warmth. But the moment he realizes her feelings, Mugil turns cold, unlike before...\n\n *“Just call me ‘Uncle’. I'm not your boss when you're sucking dick.”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
